{
  "info": {
    "name": "Tier-2 vampi-seeded (A1 stateful-authz) - FIXED",
    "description": "FIXED variant: container vampi-seeded-fixed on :5003 (statefulrolecheck=1). Admin check reads the current role from the DB, not the token claim.\n\nTHESIS-seeded fork of erev0s/VAmPI. VULNERABLE on :5002 (default baseUrl), FIXED on :5003 (statefulrolecheck=1). Users: admin/pass1 (ADMIN victim), superadmin/pass1 (ADMIN operator), name1/pass1, name2/pass2 (non-admin). Login POST /users/v1/login returns {\"auth_token\":...}; sent as Authorization: Bearer <token>. Reseed with GET /createdb before a run. Seeded endpoints: transition PUT /users/v1/{username}/role {\"role\":\"user\"|\"admin\"}; guard PUT /books/v1/{book_title}/secret {\"secret\":...}. Run the 'A1 bug demo' folder top-to-bottom: on :5002 the last PUT returns 200 (bug); on :5003 it returns 403.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5003"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "victimToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "operatorToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /createdb (reseed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/createdb",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "createdb"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Recreates the database and reseeds users and books. Call before every run."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /users/v1/login (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j && j.auth_token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.auth_token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\":\"admin\",\"password\":\"pass1\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/v1/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "v1",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Stores auth_token into {{token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /users/v1/login (superadmin)",
          "event": [
            {
